.TH NIAAML\-INFER "1" "September 2024" "" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
.B niaaml\-infer
\(en \[u1F9BE] use an optimized NiaAML pipeline to make predictions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B niaaml infer
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.I DATA_CSV_FILE
.SH OPTIONS
.SS "POSITIONAL\ ARGUMENTS"
.TP
.I data_csv_file
.I PATH
.RB [default:\  None ]
[required]
.SS "OPTIONAL\ ARGUMENTS"
.TP
.B \-\-has\-header\fR, \fB\-\-no\-has\-header
.RB [default:\  has-header ]
.TP
.B \-\-ignore\-columns
.I INTEGER
.TP
.B \-\-pipeline\-file
.I PATH
.RB [default:\  pipeline.ppln ]
.TP
.B \-\-predictions\-csv\-file
.I PATH
.RB [default:\  preds.csv ]
.TP
.B \-h\fR, \fB\-\-help
Show a help message and exit
.SH "SEE\ ALSO"
.BR niaaml (1)
.P
.BR niaaml\-optimize (1)
